Package: evomod2
Title: Individual-Based Simulations of the Evolution of Genetic Architecture
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R:
    person("Diogo", "Melo", role = c("aut", "cre"), email = "diogro@gmail.com")
Description: Individual-based simulations of multivariate quantitative traits
    under drift, stabilizing and directional selection, with additive or
    multilinear epistatic genetic architectures (Hansen and Wagner 2001
    <doi:10.1006/tpbi.2001.1520>). Extends the model of Melo and Marroig (2015)
    <doi:10.1073/pnas.1322632112>. The simulation engine is written in C++.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
Encoding: UTF-8
